{:name "weekly-review"
 :purpose "Judge the week: one judgment per intent touched, one per spec that ran, and next week's intents, reviewed where the owner plans."
 :executor :agent
 :skill "../../.claude/skills/review-week"
 :inputs {:intents {:status :open}
          :events {:last-hours 168}}
 :procedure "Follow the review-week skill, carried in full in the brief. In short: the brief's open intents are every open intent in the ledger, the vault's and every other system's alike. Judge each for the week, with a verdict and this week's events as evidence; standing intents take partial or not-applicable, never met. Judge each spec that ran more than twice by name. Propose next week's intents with propose and name any intent to drop. Each verdict on an intent is a draft the owner accepts or overrules, and each proposal one the owner opens or drops. Finish with one review/summary event and end the attempt."
 :output {:judge {:targets [:id] :verdict :keyword :evidence [:id] :note :string :window {:start :date :end :date}}
          :review/summary {:judged :int :refused :int :proposed :int}}
 :criterion "Every open intent with a horizon inside this week has a judgment by Sunday night."
 :check {:query "kernel/events-in-attempt" :in {:kind :review/summary}}
 :acts-on [:commitments :activity]
 :trigger {:weekly :sunday :at "18:00"}
 :budget {:minutes 30}}
